    "finalName": "",
    "description": "When you interact with another sentient creature, you can use a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> to reduce the impression you leave on it. When you have finished interacting with the creature, you make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check, and if the check result exceeds the target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a>, it does not remember interacting with you once you are gone.<br><br>A target that is higher in level than you gains a +5 bonus to its <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a> to resist this ability. This is a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mind-Affecting\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind-Affecting\">Mind-Affecting</a> effect.",
